-- ADR-0056 decision 3 items 2 and 3 (contract `Location.altered`): on findings, the altered parts
-- merged per location and scan job, and the altered state of the row when its false positive was
-- marked. Generated by drizzle-kit. Nullable columns without a default and without a constraint:
-- catalog-only changes on `findings`, which may be large, no table rewrite and nothing to validate
-- (AGENTS.md, ADR-0028). The runtime role already has table-level UPDATE on `findings` (it updates
-- rows on later scans and false-positive marking; migration 0012 revokes only DELETE / TRUNCATE).
-- Event objects carry `ObjectRef.altered` inside `access_events.objects` (jsonb, as sent), which
-- the runtime role cannot update (migration 0022): no column for it.
ALTER TABLE "findings" ADD COLUMN "false_positive_altered" text[];--> statement-breakpoint
ALTER TABLE "findings" ADD COLUMN "altered" text[];